@startuml 05-runtime-save-load
!pragma layout smetana
' 运行时责任 4/4：系统存档画面、指令存档和变量快照
' 来源：GameProc/system_state_machine.h, execution_engine.h,
'       GameData/Variable/variable_storage.h, GameData/era_binary_data.h, eraengine.cpp

title 运行时：存档与读档集成

package "GameProc" {
  class ScriptRunner {
    + executeLine(SAVEGAME / LOADGAME)
    + onInputProvided(value)
  }

  class SystemStateMachine {
    + requestSaveLoad(save)
    + resume(value)
    + beginSaveGame()
    + beginLoadGame()
    + saveGameWaitInput()
    + loadGameWaitInput()
    - m_prevStates : QList<SystemStateCode>
    .. SaveGame_* / LoadGame_* states ..
  }

  struct SystemHost {
    + saveDataNos() : int
    + checkData(index, message) : bool
    + saveTo(index, text) : bool
    + loadFrom(index) : bool
    + saveData / loadData callbacks
  }

  class ExecutionEngine {
    + reloadSaveSnapshots()
    + loadSaveSnapshot(index) : bool
    + writeSaveSnapshot(index, description) : bool
    + checkSaveSnapshot(index) : int
    + handleSaveData(line)
    + handleLoadData(line)
    + SAVEGLOBAL / LOADGLOBAL
    + SAVEDATA / LOADDATA
  }

  enum SystemStateCode {
    SaveGame_Begin
    SaveGame_WaitInput
    SaveGame_WaitInputOverwrite
    LoadGame_Begin
    LoadGame_WaitInput
  }

  class EraEngine {
    + reloadSavedData()
    + buildSystemHost()
    + provideInput(value)
  }
}

package "GameData/Variable" {
  class VariableStorage {
    + captureBinarySave(type, chars) : Document
    + applyBinarySave(document)
    + saveReadiness() : SaveReadiness
    + resetForNewGame()
    + readSaveEntry(entry, slot)
    + writeSaveEntry(entry, slot, value)
  }

  class VariableTable
  class "erasave::Map" as SaveMap {
    + build(config, variableTable, type)
    + findByName(name) : Entry
  }
}

package "GameData" {
  class "EraBinaryData::Document" as Document {
    + encode()
    + encodeText()
    + decode()
    + decodeText()
    + Version = 1809
  }
  class SaveFile <<sav/*.sav>>
}

ScriptRunner --> SystemStateMachine : SAVEGAME / LOADGAME
SystemStateMachine *-- SystemHost : injected callbacks
SystemStateMachine --> EraEngine : host callbacks are assembled here
SystemStateMachine --> ExecutionEngine : save/load snapshot callback
SystemStateMachine --> SystemStateCode : SaveGame_* / LoadGame_*
EraEngine --> SystemStateMachine : provide input / run
EraEngine --> ExecutionEngine : reloadSavedData
ExecutionEngine --> VariableStorage : capture/apply
ExecutionEngine --> Document : encode/decode
VariableStorage --> SaveMap : entries and loci
SaveMap --> VariableTable : SAVEDATA declarations
Document --> SaveFile

note right of SystemStateMachine
  SAVEGAME / LOADGAME are system flows:
  requestSaveLoad() stores the return state,
  enters SaveGame_Begin or LoadGame_Begin,
  waits for a slot, then calls the SystemHost callback.
  The callbacks keep UI state handling out of storage.
end note

note bottom of ExecutionEngine
  SAVEGLOBAL/LOADGLOBAL and SAVEDATA/LOADDATA
  are instruction-level paths. SAVEGAME/LOADGAME
  select a normal snapshot through SystemStateMachine.
  All variable snapshots converge on VariableStorage's
  captureBinarySave/applyBinarySave pair.
end note

note right of Document
  Version is a single format contract. Decode rejects
  incompatible or corrupt data atomically; the caller may
  treat an unsupported slot as overwriteable empty data.
  Private SAVEDATA keys are made by the save mapping layer
  from segment identity and name; this diagram leaves the
  key construction to 11-save-format.
end note

legend bottom
  This diagram describes runtime integration only. File encoding,
  private key spelling and entry ordering are documented in 11-save-format.
endlegend
@enduml
